Testing that a device or a prefix that a listed prefix covers is left out
of the flowtable: the kernel compares the hook names over the length of the
shorter one and refuses the whole list otherwise. Here the wildcard of the
guest zone covers the wireless port of br-lan and its WDS port prefix.

